OL,3,GNEWSAJogger grabbed by e-scooter rider
OL,4,Ain park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman jogging through a Derby park
OL,7,Fwas grabbed by a man on an e-scooter,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FThe runner was in King George V Playing
OL,11,FFields in Littleover at about 06:30 BST
OL,12,Fon Saturday when a man grabbed her arm
OL,13,Fand pulled her towards him in an
OL,14,Fincident Derbyshire Police is treating
OL,15,Fas a sexual offence.
OL,17,FThe woman managed to escape and left
OL,18,Fthe park, a spokesperson for the force
OL,19,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
