OL,3,GNEWSAJogger grabbed by e-scooter rider
OL,4,Ain park
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Neil Dutton, of the Littleover,
OL,7,FMickleover and Sunnyhill beat team,
OL,8,Fsaid patrols had been stepped up
OL,9,Ffollowing the incident and asked for
OL,10,Fanyone with information to make
OL,11,Fcontact.
